{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011rQd8c6PJgw5kM8cSX3hQ8","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-14\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp_015_metrics_expansion（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n- exp_007_ner_multi_model（已分配 autodl-5090 GPU:cuda:3，等待提交）\\\\n- exp_003_ner_wnut17（已分配 autodl-5090 GPU:cuda:2，等待提交）\\\\n- exp_002_ner_conll2003（已分配 autodl-5090 GPU:cuda:1，等待提交）\\\\n- exp_001_ner_n16_scierc（已分配 autodl-5090 GPU:cuda:0，等待提交）\\\\n- exp_007_ner_llama（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_005** (success): —\\\\n  [exp005_temperature_analysis](/api/workspace-files/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/exp_005/report/summary.md)\\\\n- **exp_014_entity_majority_voting** (success): —\\\\n- **exp_013_exact_match_voting** (negative): —\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 5 / 负向 6 / 失败 1 / 共 13\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nautodl-5090: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\\\ngpu-5090-4x-2: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- ft_002: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pilot_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 838, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wu92eCYwKdyoJWiTMSxkmo","session_id":"e37c9bd6-dc13-41f5-9c3a-b482146d5201","uuid":"c316b304-1eb6-488f-b116-c36283cdf53f","timestamp":"2026-05-14T11:48:27.469Z"}
