{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XgqHwDvCfemBDCD8ZxZST3","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# struct_self_consist_ie — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 11:47 UTC | 更新原因: Baseline 全部完成，4 GPU 实验已 ALLOCATED，exp-005 完成，更新近期任务\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n系统比较 4 类置信信号（log-prob / exact-match / FK / SJ / voting_conf）在 IE test-time scaling 中的有效性。核心发现：structural consistency family (SJ + voting_conf) 在 NER 上 2.5x 优于 log-prob，但 RE 因复合错误传播所有信号退化。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research 阶段** — Baseline 全部完成（决定性正面），4 个 P0 GPU 实验已 ALLOCATED 等待执行。\\\\n\\\\n### Baseline 结论（exp-012/013/014，全部完成）\\\\n- **SJ >> log-prob**: NER ρ=0.383 vs 0.140 (Δ=+0.243), AUROC 0.689 vs 0.591\\\\n- **voting_conf ≈ SJ**: NER ρ=0.392 vs 0.383 (统计持平), RE ρ=0.340 vs 0.244 (voting 更优)\\\\n- **exact_match ≈ FK**: NER ρ=0.294 vs 0.259, 均弱于 SJ/voting\\\\n- **结论**: Structural consistency family (SJ + voting_conf) 远优于所有替代方案，framing 成立\\\\n\\\\n### exp-005 温度分析（完成）\\\\n- SJ 温度鲁棒性最强（NER Δρ=+0.005, RE Δρ=-0.010）\\\\n- FK 温度敏感（NER Δρ=+0.062, RE Δρ=-0.095）\\\\n- Conditional filtering >> temperature tuning（RE SJ: cond lift +0.07~0.14 vs temp effect ±0.01）\\\\n- 推荐 T=1.0 + conditional filtering\\\\n\\\\n### MVP 结论\\\\n- NER: rho_sj=0.388, SJ>FK +12pp (p=2e-20) → PASS\\\\n- RE full: rho_sj=0.234 → FAIL | RE cond: rho_sj=0.372 → 强信号\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] Dream 1 分析 → 结构性问题识别\\\\n- [x] 修订 paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n- [x] Baseline 实验 (exp-012/013/014) — **决定性正面，SJ 贡献确认**\\\\n- [x] exp-005 温度敏感性分析 — 完成\\\\n- [x] logprob 脚本集成到 run_mvp_pilot.py（--collect_logprobs）\\\\n- [ ] **4 个 GPU 实验执行中**：exp-001 (SciERC N=16, cuda:0), exp-002 (CoNLL, cuda:1), exp-003 (WNUT, cuda:2), exp-007 (LLaMA, cuda:3)\\\\n- [ ] run_mvp_pilot.py `--dataset` 加 conll2003/wnut17 选项（exp-002/00